.vercel

# graphify knowledge-graph output. Local + regenerable, never commit.
# Several repos here auto-deploy on push (netlify.toml / vercel.json / GH Actions),
# so an un-ignored graphify-out/ would publish a multi-MB graph.json + graph.html
# to the live site. Added 2026-08-06 BEFORE the first graph was built.
graphify-out/

# Kept off the server: this repo publishes its ROOT, so a tracked CLAUDE.md
# would be served live. Same reason as frontline-website, hffa-site,
# early-bird-coffee and maui-food-truck-websites. Keep this line.
CLAUDE.md
